<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n58677" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκύνθ-ινος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>made</i> or <i>obtained from gourds</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλαιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PRev.Laws</u>
					39.6
				</span></i>
			 (written <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυκινθ</span>-, cf. <i><span class="en">
				59.21
			</span></i>, also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολυκυντ</span>- <i><span class="en">
				40.10
			</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκυντ</span>- <i><span class="en">
				55.9
			</span></i>, al., <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλοῖα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>VH</u>
					2.37
				</span></i>
			:—hence Com. name <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κολοκυνθο-πειρᾱταί</span></b> , οἱ,
				<i>gourd-pirates</i>, ibid. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμπέλου κολοκυν [θίνης</span>], a kind
			of vine, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PCair.Zen.</u>
				33.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
